@ChroniclesAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5237

### Get All Characters
GET {{ChroniclesAPI_HostAddress}}/api/characters
Accept: application/json

###

### Get FantasyCharacter by ID
GET {{ChroniclesAPI_HostAddress}}/api/characters/2
Accept: application/json

###

### Create FantasyCharacter
POST {{ChroniclesAPI_HostAddress}}/api/characters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TestCharacter",
  "level": 1
}

###

### Delete FantasyCharacter by ID
DELETE {{ChroniclesAPI_HostAddress}}/api/characters/2
Content-Type: application/json

###
